            "review_title": "Review at La Smoke House",
            "review_text": "yyhhh\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nNo\nDec 2020 • Friends\nBig meat platter 4 to 5 people. It's so small, only enough for 3. Basically you get French fries and bread and some little meat, side dishes are ridiculously small. They forgot sausage, corn, mashed potatoe and onion rings. Not 1kg like in descrobtion. We had no napkins, food was cold, Mojito has no rum at all. Restaurant is a complete disaster.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
