            "review_text": "pacowvietnam\nSydney, Australia11 contributions\n0\nSad excuse for bbq\nAug 2018 • Couples\nService was slow and when food arrived was cold! Stone cold! The salad was was hotter! I complained and they me told its precooked. Thats ok but hot food should be hot and cold should be cold. Its a shame really, they take q long time to slow cook the beef and pork then serve it cold. \n\nLooks good on platter when it arrive, but soon let down when tried it as it was cold. \n\nGet this they put it in microwave and brought it back to me. \n\nCould be good restuarant.\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2018",
