            "review_text": "SaintLil\n1 contribution\n0\nFirst time - La Smoke House\nJul 2018 • Friends\nThe meat dishes at La Smoke House🐮🐮 are soft, spicy, baked and have the traditional taste of the South American standard.\n\nSet BBQ have pig meat , smoked sausage, chicken, beef, you can call set size L for 5 to 7 people.\n\nThe meat is served with CRAFT BEER made from barley and hops.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 12, 2018",
