            "review_title": "Review at La Smoke House",
            "review_text": "EM-Han\nNha Trang, Vietnam120 contributions\n1\nBest BBQ Steak in Saigon\nJan 2018 • Friends\nEverything at La Smokehouse has been planned and executed to perfection, from the perfectly barbequed steaks, to the very nice red wine, the generous green salad with delicious, creamy vinaigrette to the best cole slaw I have ever eaten, the service efficient and the waiters could not be more friendly. I plan to go back and taste everything on the menu. The cost rating exaggerates this is a $$, and by far the best value, Australian beef steaks, 2 perfectly grilled, tender 200g steaks for 400,000đv, is half what other steakhouses charge. Dinner for two with 3 glasses of a delicious, room-temperature un-known red wine @ 85,000/glass was 750,000đv or $65 US. A wonderful red wine/green peppercorn sauce accompanied the steaks. I would really love these steaks with Bearnaise sauce, and I would have wished for a chocolate mousse or chocolate, or even better, Giandujia, chocolate-hazelnut soufflé, would be something very unique in HoChiMinh City.\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2018",
